cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Cite the software and its technical report using the same preferred
  citation below. Identify the software version or commit used, and the
  report revision and evidence manifest when referring to measurements.
type: software
title: "Limit Order Book: A Price-Time Priority Matching Engine for C++, C, and Python"
abstract: >-
  limit-order-book is a header-only C++ limit order book with a price-time
  priority matching policy for reception of market data streams, a C API
  compiled into a shared library, and a Python package that binds C++ directly
  through Cython.
authors:
